// The golden compile hash per shipped map (hex, u64) — DATA, so the editor can bless a
// deliberate map change without editing code. The diff review stays: a changed line here IS
// the deliberate-change record.
[
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-03 (Świat w Skali): the 12 wrecks shrank from a 6.8×3.2×12.4 m bus to a
    // real knocked-out-hull footprint (~3.5×2.2×6.5 m), so a live tank no longer looks miniature
    // beside one — and the Ostrogorsk factory pair's scrambled wider-than-long box is corrected.
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-05 (teren C3): the valley's first roads (quarry-gravel crossing
    // tracks, cobbled Kamienna street, the bridge causeway — RoadProfile's debut), the
    // second floodplain terrace, meadow swales and the bridgehead bluffs. Water contract,
    // playability BFS and symmetry held un-relaxed.
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-05 (hero flora), ALL FOUR MAPS: the procedural willow/poplar
    // scenery and every retired FloraPine entry are gone, and the hero oak replaced the
    // stylized download pack.
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-06 (hero flora, LOD ladder), ALL FOUR MAPS: the count the earlier
    // bless promised would "rise when trees get runtime LOD" has risen. Instanced trees pick
    // a rung by distance, so a DISTANT oak costs ~0.03 ms/frame against the ~0.59 it cost
    // baked — the scatters go to three mirrored pairs each while the boulevard avenue, which
    // stands metres from the camera and pays fill rather than triangles, only goes two deep.
    // Ostrogorsk: 26 trees at 15.62 ms of the 16.667 ms min-spec gate (42 measured 16.16 —
    // a pass with no room, which is not a pass). Dressing only; cover, terrain, roads and
    // gameplay stand untouched.
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-06 (hero flora, solid trunks), ALL FOUR MAPS: the hero oak stops
    // being a painting. Every authored tree now compiles a TreeLine box around its VISIBLE
    // trunk — a shell stops in bark, an eye stops with it, and a hull pushes the tree over
    // instead of driving through it. The canopy is deliberately left uncovered: leaves do not
    // stop an AP round, and cover a crew cannot see itself taking is the dishonest kind. The
    // boxes are DERIVED from the scatter, so a mirrored pair gets mirrored trunks and the two
    // can never drift. They wear the new `TreeTrunk` kind — a hedgerow's crushable, felling
    // behaviour with a mature bole's 240 hp, and the only kind that bakes no box of its own,
    // because the tree's mesh is already standing in it. Trunks per map: 26 / 26 / 18 / 16.
    // Playability, symmetry and the cover contracts held un-relaxed.
    ("bystra_valley", "9cb15c9f4492855d"),
    ("orliny_pereval", "164c0b3f69aa2c5c"),
    // Re-blessed 2026-08-05 (teren C4): the berm's east borrow ditch, broken at the gates
    // — the dossier's own sculpt-session TODO, closed with form + materia, no mechanism.
    ("ostrogorsk", "b5f17ba3cca56752"),
    ("prokhorovka_hill_252_2", "88024bec70291d54"),
]
